EctoPad iOS three-dot menu hierarchy and stable button appearance, 2026-09-02

Apply after the existing EctoPad Aurora iOS overlay patches with
`git apply --unidiff-zero`.

- Make UIKit own the ellipsis glyph, circular fill, and border through one
  explicit UIButtonConfiguration so menu dismissal cannot synthesize a square
  selected appearance. Tint the symbol itself white with always-original
  rendering so UIKit cannot substitute the system accent color.
- Keep an iOS 14 legacy fallback because the device target remains iOS 14+.
- Group Render Resolution and Aspect Ratio under Display.
- Keep Show FPS Counter independent at the top level.
- Group controller mapping and touch settings under Controls.
- Give Game Data & Saves an internal-drive icon.
- Replace the loose log-sharing item with a final Report a Problem flow that
  can export the existing privacy-redacted log or open EctoPad's GitHub issue
  form directly.
- Restore alpha and repeat overlay z-order recovery on the next main-queue turn
  after foregrounding.
- Extend the interaction harness to require the new hierarchy and configured
  menu-button appearance.

